# Limitations

ProfitLens is currently under active development.

The initial development dataset does not represent a real company's complete financial system and may not contain every business domain required for full net-profit analysis.

Therefore, early versions may focus on **revenue, cost, gross profit, gross margin, transaction behavior, product profitability, and other areas supported by the available data**.

Additional data sources will be integrated only when they can be obtained and validated appropriately.

---

# Project Goals

The project has two complementary goals:

### Product Goal

Build a realistic, deployable Business Intelligence and Decision Support Platform capable of supporting real business workflows.

### Engineering & Data Science Goal

Demonstrate an end-to-end Data Science workflow covering:

```text
Data Engineering
      ↓
Analytics
      ↓
Statistics
      ↓
Feature Engineering
      ↓
Machine Learning
      ↓
Decision Support
      ↓
Generative AI
      ↓
API Development
      ↓
Deployment
      ↓
Monitoring
```

---

# Disclaimer

ProfitLens is an independent development project.

The initial dataset is synthetic and should not be interpreted as real company financial data.

Any predictions, recommendations, or financial assessments generated during development are intended for analytical and demonstration purposes unless validated against appropriate real-world business data.

